  "implementation": [
    "Rebuilt the right bridge descent as six risers plus a turned jointed-granite walk; old11-riser route and stale planting coordinates removed.",
    "Excavated the east inlet, narrowed the stair apron to its actual width/depth, and used -0.34m as the outside support-mask datum; the complete pond is no longer inadvertently floored at zero.",
    "Solid terrain cores carry staggered uniform scanned rocks; steep soil exposes the same geological scan in world-metric triplanar coordinates.",
    "A dedicated rock headland outside the true hall plinth supports the right lantern. Removed the formerly buried spare lantern exposed by excavation.",
    "Authored woody multi-lobed shrubs carry folded individual leaves and five separately folded flower petals; island/shore colonies and three bank tiers are rooted in actual soil or declared island rock envelope.",
    "Rebuilt the occupied upper gallery with distinct plaster, thick rotated shutters and lattice bays, a shallower porch, flat timber crests and selected small metal caps. Two duplicated corner posts are removed.",
    "Actual pierced carved cheeks now occur on all front bearing axes, preserving roof/floor support datums.",
    "One shared world-oriented sky still supplies visible atmosphere, water reflection and PMREM. R10 retains R09 calibrated sky/solar radiance and four actual room-versus-exterior native cube captures. Global exposure remains1.02; no hemisphere or unshadowed fill light is added."
  ],
